      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T15:37:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems better to initialize the two types of messages at construction time so they can be private final, or even better, static final. I doubt that we\u0027ll need to add another family to this code for the next few decades so you could just have two static final members (sIpv4SockDiagReq, sIpv6SockDiagReq) that are constant for the life of this code.\n\nThese should be called *Req instead of *Msg because they\u0027re StructInetDiagReqV2 objects, not InetDiagMessage objects.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 142,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 142,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "7616c477b0cffe72c5cf53d33485d4c87d34bfb0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
